1
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,660
-别问 -别说
- Don't ask. - Don't tell.

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,360
反正或许也挺明显的
It's probably obvious, anyway.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,586
我哭了一夜
I was up all night crying.

4
00:00:07,586 --> 00:00:10,140
看看她在不在家 歌洛莉亚
Let's see if she's here. Gloria?!

5
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:12,000
莎拉·芬克 我的实验室伙伴
Sarah Fink, my lab partner

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,920
我原希望有一天能成为我的爱情伴侣
who I hoped one day would be my love partner.

7
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:17,040
我发现某个我所谓的朋友在勾搭她
I caught one of my so-called friends hitting on her,

8
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,400
现在她就跟我们以前
and now she's like the fetal pig

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,620
一起做实验用的小猪一样
we once so happily shared --

10
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,660
冰凉 冷漠 无心
Cold, unresponsive, heartless.

11
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:23,820
你现在有两个选择
You got two choices --

12
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:26,820
你可以爬到楼上 沉浸在伤心浴缸中
You can mope your way up those stairs and soak in a pity bath,

13
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:29,780
也可以提起精神 昂首挺胸去学校
or you can pick yourself up, march into that school,

14
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:32,300
假装你根本不认识那姑娘
and act like you don't even know that girl.

15
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:33,760
谢谢
Thanks.

16
00:00:33,847 --> 00:00:36,595
如果老妈问 就说我借了她的浴缸枕
If mom asks, I borrowed her tub pillow.

17
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:40,740
杰 别忘了一会儿把乔载去米奇和小卡家
Jay, don't forget to drop Joe at Mitch and Cam's later.

18
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:43,600
好 他们要我几点去...
Yeah, what time are they expecting me to, uh --

19
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:44,476
什么情况
Oh, what the hell?

20
00:00:44,476 --> 00:00:46,643
是不是很萌啊
Oh, isn't it cute?

21
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:48,540
昨晚我去做美甲的时候
Last night when I went to do my nails,

22
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:50,020
那里的小姑娘给他做着玩的
the girls did it just for fun.

23
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:52,940
-造成一辈子的性别困惑有什么好玩的 -拜托
- What's fun about a lifetime of gender confusion? - Ay, please.

24
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:55,500
这不就跟你带他去看道奇队的比赛
It's the same as when you took him to the Dodgers game

25
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,300
回来还戴上了道奇队的帽子一样嘛
and you brought him back with that Dodgers cap.

26
00:00:57,300 --> 00:01:00,240
你觉得呢 当然是大大不一样了
You think? Or is it different in every conceivable respect?

27
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:02,862
别忘了菲尔还在米奇和小卡家
Ay, and don't forget that Phil is gonna be meeting you

28
00:01:02,862 --> 00:01:03,480
等着帮你
at Mitch and Cam's

29
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:06,260
把莉莉的公主城堡搬来这里呢
to help you bring Lily's princess castle here.

30
00:01:06,371 --> 00:01:08,955
莉莉已经不玩那个了 但乔喜欢得很呢
She's outgrown it, but Joe loves that thing.

31
00:01:08,955 --> 00:01:10,020
别做那种表情
Ay, don't make that face.

32
00:01:10,020 --> 00:01:11,420
-你会搬回来的吧 -当然了 亲爱的
- You're gonna bring it, right? - Sure, honey.

33
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:12,080
好了 扶着他
Okay. Hold him.

34
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:15,540
薰衣草浴盐用完了 可真会挑时候
I picked a fine time to run out of lavender bath beads.

35
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,500
我原本想要两个猛男儿子
I wanted two rough and tumble boys.

36
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:19,440
结果我有了曼尼[修手指甲]
I got a Manny...

37
00:01:19,715 --> 00:01:21,068
和帕蒂姑娘[修脚趾甲]
and a Pedi.

38
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:36,020
她是我第一个女朋友 真的
She's my first girlfriend, really.

39
00:01:37,060 --> 00:01:39,000
明天这个时候 她就会在我们的客厅里
This time tomorrow, she'll be in our living room,

40
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,800
如果能顺利通过门廊的话
if we can fit her through the doorway.

41
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,607
行了 我忍不住要问一问了
Okay, I feel like I have to ask.

42
00:01:42,607 --> 00:01:44,560
老爸想买个吃豆小姐游戏机
Dad's about to buy a "Miss pac-man."

43
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:46,460
是女士 刚刚纠正你多久了
Ms. What was our struggle for?

44
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,480
不是普通的吃豆女士游戏机
And not just any "Ms. Pac-man,"

45
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:52,700
而是1982年原装修复的矮款
but an original 1982 fully reconditioned podium-style unit.

46
00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:54,717
带有原始的退币口
With original coin return.

47
00:01:54,717 --> 00:01:56,560
他们还送了凳子呢
They're even throwing in the stool.

48
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,280
拜托
Come on!

49
00:01:58,220 --> 00:02:00,192
好吧 你是对的 是挺傻的
Oh, you know, you're right. It's stupid.

50
00:02:00,192 --> 00:02:01,480
那会占据实用东西的空间
Just be taking up space we need

51
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,480
比如那架钢琴 等等 是吗
for things we actually use, like the piano -- oh, wait.

52
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,540
你怎么回事
What's going on with you?

53
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:06,580
我头疼得厉害
Oh, I have a throbbing headache.

54
00:02:06,780 --> 00:02:08,260
搞得我很难去
It's making it hard to...

55
00:02:08,260 --> 00:02:09,087
装病吗
Pretend that you're sick?

56
00:02:09,087 --> 00:02:11,220
是啊 你刚刚才吃了一大碗麦片
Yeah, you just ate a bushel of cereal.

57
00:02:11,220 --> 00:02:13,717
检查一下奖牌盒有没有坏 小表砸们
Check the structural integrity of the trophy case, bitches,

58
00:02:13,717 --> 00:02:16,320
因为老娘又要带点家伙什回来了
'cause mama's bringing home some hardware!

59
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:17,760
今天是学校颁奖日
Awards day at school --

60
00:02:18,020 --> 00:02:20,860
一年中只有这天艾丽克斯会趾高气昂地走路
The one day of the year Alex has some real swagger.

61
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,360
讽刺的是 她非常不擅长这个
Ironically, the one thing she's not good at.

62
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:25,220
我说奖牌 你说奖牌
When I say "Trophy," You say "Trophy"!

63
00:02:25,580 --> 00:02:25,600
奖牌
Trophy!

64
00:02:26,540 --> 00:02:26,940
奖牌
Trophy!

65
00:02:27,298 --> 00:02:29,320
能给我点那什么吗
Can I get a wha-what?

66
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:29,600
什么
What?

67
00:02:34,980 --> 00:02:37,400
我一直担心艾丽克斯拿了那么多奖
I always worried that Alex winning all those awards

68
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:39,620
会刺激到卢克 结果好像真的刺激到了
would bother Luke, and looks like it finally did.

69
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:43,200
在一个超级明星姐姐的阴影下长大 实属不易
Can't be easy growing up in the shadow of a superstar sister.

70
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:44,700
看看米奇尔就知道了
Look at Mitchell.

71
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,620
你有皇后吗
Okay, do you have any queens?

72
00:02:50,300 --> 00:02:51,600
有啊 两个呢
Yeah, two big ones.

73
00:02:51,780 --> 00:02:53,440
好了 你知道吗 第一次这么说是很搞笑
Okay, you know what? It was funny the first time.

74
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,400
现在就显得很刻薄了
Now it's just getting mean.

75
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,140
怎么回事
What was that?

76
00:02:56,286 --> 00:02:59,300
波拉斯基先生 我们楼上的邻居 上周去世了
Mr. Polasky, our upstairs neighbor, died last week.

77
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:01,619
他93岁了 而且生病有段日子了
He was 93, and he'd been sick for a while.

78
00:03:01,619 --> 00:03:03,140
所以 我们...我们想让他开心点
Yeah, and we -- we tried cheering him up

79
00:03:03,140 --> 00:03:05,040
就在前庭挂了个"好起来"的标语
with a "Get well" sign in the front yard.

80
00:03:05,780 --> 00:03:07,100
好了 看起来怎么样
Okay, how's that look?

81
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:08,280
很不错
Looks great.

82
00:03:08,740 --> 00:03:09,117
说真的
Honestly.

83
00:03:09,117 --> 00:03:10,845
不 不
Oh. No! No.

84
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:12,580
"好起来 孩子"
"Get well son"?

85
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:13,840
好了 算了
Okay, well, you know what?

86
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,520
反正"快点"显得有点专横
"Soon" seemed a little bossy anyway.

87
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,460
米奇和我一直在商量
Mitchell and I have always discussed

88
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:18,400
如果斯坦有什么不测
trying to buy the place

89
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,900
我们就把他的房子买下来
in the event something happened to Stan.

90
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:22,040
我们可以用多出来的空间改造成客房
We -- we could use the extra space for a guest room

91
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:23,860
或者办公室 甚至是
or an office or maybe even...

92
00:03:23,860 --> 00:03:24,540
育婴室
a nursery.

93
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:27,380
我想再养个孩子
I think I may want another child.

94
00:03:27,380 --> 00:03:29,100
但我不想告诉米奇尔
But I don't want to bring it up to Mitchell

95
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:30,020
给他造成压力
and put pressure on him

96
00:03:30,020 --> 00:03:32,380
因为他一直很坚定地表示不想再养了
because he's been so adamant about not wanting one.

97
00:03:32,380 --> 00:03:34,500
他最不想要的就是...
The last thing he's thinking about is a...

98
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:35,120
育婴室
Nursery.

99
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,421
最近我情绪有点不稳定
Lately, I've been having stirrings,

100
00:03:37,421 --> 00:03:40,420
但因为过去就像是一辆可怕的情绪过山车
but because it was such an emotional roller coaster in the past,

101
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:41,680
我不想再经历一遍
I don't want to bring it up

102
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,740
除非我得到了某种启示...
unless I have some sort of indication...

103
00:03:43,740 --> 00:03:45,680
我们意见一致
That we're both on the same page.

104
00:03:45,880 --> 00:03:48,460
所以当歌洛莉亚问我们能否照看乔时
That's why, when Gloria asked if we'd watch Joe,

105
00:03:48,460 --> 00:03:49,620
我说 当然啦
I said "Sure."

106
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:51,660
那或许可以提醒米奇尔
It'd be a chance to remind Mitchell

107
00:03:51,660 --> 00:03:54,420
拥有宝宝的感觉有多好
how nice it is to...have a baby.

108
00:03:58,980 --> 00:03:59,780
克莱尔·邓菲
Claire Dunphy.

109
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:01,520
有什么能帮你做的
What can I do you for?

110
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:03,409
你可帮我"做"不了什么
Oh, it's not so much what you can do me for.

111
00:04:03,409 --> 00:04:05,600
听起来有点淫荡
Sounded a -- a tiny bit prostitute-y.

112
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:06,160
抱歉
I'm sorry about that.

113
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:08,360
实际上 我的确要请你帮个小忙
Actually, I do have a tiny favor to ask.

114
00:04:08,380 --> 00:04:09,428
我爱你的家人
You know, I love your family.

115
00:04:09,428 --> 00:04:11,600
-海莉是我们的返校节女王 -好吧
- I mean, Haley, our homecoming queen. - Yeah.

116
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:14,520
现在艾丽克斯赢得了每个学术奖项
And now Alex winning just about every academic award.

117
00:04:14,580 --> 00:04:17,340
-我懂的 -教邓菲家的孩子是我的荣幸
- I know. - It's been an honor to teach the dunphy children.

118
00:04:17,580 --> 00:04:19,360
我是来谈谈卢克的事的
Well, today I'm here to talk about Luke.

119
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,200
是做实验用的小兔子吗
Is that the science rabbit?

120
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:23,480
是我儿子
That's my son.

121
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:25,160
当然啦
Yes. Of course.

122
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:26,020
我想说的就是跟这个有关的
That's sort of the point.

123
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,800
我觉得他感觉有点被忽视了
I think he's feeling a little bit overlooked.

124
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:29,520
我想知道你能不能
I was wondering if you could just,

125
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:32,160
今天颁给他一个奖项
you know, toss him one of those awards today.

126
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:33,320
就...
Just...

127
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:35,660
恐怕所有的获奖者
Well, I'm afraid all of the award winners

128
00:04:35,660 --> 00:04:36,800
都已经决定了
have already been decided.

129
00:04:38,420 --> 00:04:40,660
不过 如果这能让他感觉更好的话
Oh, but, hey, if it makes him feel better,

130
00:04:40,740 --> 00:04:42,800
他之前在竞争品格正直奖
he was in the running for the integrity award.

131
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:44,240
他只是被对手打败了
He just got edged out by --

132
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:44,900
斯科特·威勒吗
Scott Wheeler?

133
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,420
那小子简直是个缉毒特警
Oh, that little weasel's a narc.

134
00:04:46,420 --> 00:04:48,339
2008年万圣节嘉年华
Halloween carnival, 2008 --

135
00:04:48,339 --> 00:04:51,523
"邓菲太太的葡萄汁闻起来有药味"
"Mrs. Dunphy's grape juice smells like medicine."

136
00:04:51,940 --> 00:04:53,040
那个上午好漫长
It was a long morning.

137
00:04:53,380 --> 00:04:56,520
这对他来说会意义重大的
It would mean so much to him.

138
00:04:56,860 --> 00:04:57,280
克莱尔
Well, Claire...

139
00:04:58,260 --> 00:04:59,160
那不公平
That wouldn't be fair.

140
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,960
我不知道 对不起
I know. I'm sorry.

141
00:05:01,540 --> 00:05:02,717
非常抱歉
I'm so sorry.

142
00:05:02,717 --> 00:05:05,364
我真的好令人感到难堪
I-I-I really am -- so embarrassing.

143
00:05:05,364 --> 00:05:07,053
也许我能
Maybe there's some sort of, um --

144
00:05:07,053 --> 00:05:09,700
我说不好 捐一笔钱
I don't know, like, a -- a -- a donation or something

145
00:05:09,700 --> 00:05:12,960
给汽车店 来给车轮上上油 促成事儿
I could give to the auto shop to, um...grease the wheels.

146
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:14,480
我们不缺油
We're good on grease.

147
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:16,520
但是有多少制动液都不嫌多[打住]
But you can never have too much brake fluid, so --

148
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:20,818
也许足球队需要一些防滑钉
Or perhaps the soccer team could use some new cleats,

149
00:05:20,818 --> 00:05:22,800
-帮他们 -反击吗[回扣]
- help them get their... - Kick back?

150
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:25,380
好了 邓菲太太 我真的在尽量
Okay, Mrs. Dunphy, I'm really doing everything I can

151
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:27,740
无视你想贿赂我 从而让你儿子获得
to ignore the fact that you're trying to bribe me

152
00:05:27,740 --> 00:05:29,880
马龙·邦尼菲斯品格正直奖这一事实
for the Marlon Boniface integrity award.

153
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:31,580
很高兴你能记得那个名字
I'm so glad you can remember that name,

154
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,860
但你连卢克都记不住
but you can't remember Luke.

155
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,660
我这个月第一次放假
My first day off in a month,

156
00:05:35,660 --> 00:05:37,600
我要出去跟歌洛莉亚逛街
I'm headed out the door to go shopping with Gloria,

157
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:40,520
结果我的蠢老板需要我去拿兰花
and my stupid boss needs me to pick up some stupid orchid.

158
00:05:40,700 --> 00:05:42,580
好像我的时间就不值钱一样
Like my time's not valuable?

159
00:05:42,580 --> 00:05:44,800
歌洛莉亚要帮我选足环呢
Gloria was gonna help me pick out a toe ring.

160
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,834
我不管你是不是非法的[偷渡民]
Oh, I don't care if you are here illegally,

161
00:05:47,834 --> 00:05:49,780
你太美了
you're gorgeous.

162
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:51,583
听着先生 告诉你一下 我...
Listen, mister, for your information, I am --

163
00:05:51,583 --> 00:05:53,714
花 他说的是花
Flower. He's talking...flower.

164
00:05:53,740 --> 00:05:55,520
加文 我想给你介绍...
Gavin, I would like to introduce you --

165
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,598
我要的米兰秀的照片呢
Where are the photos from the Milan Show I asked for?

166
00:05:57,598 --> 00:05:59,680
我不记得你要过啊
I-I don't remember you asking for them.

167
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:02,100
我想我俩之间有人搞错了 但是是谁呢
Oh. I guess one of us is mistaken, but who?

168
00:06:02,180 --> 00:06:04,160
因为引领了袜子新长度
The fashion icon profiled by Vanity Fair

169
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,580
而登上《名利场》的时尚偶像
for pioneering a new sock length,

170
00:06:05,580 --> 00:06:08,780
还是共用订书机的兼职员工
or the part-time employee who shares a stapler?

171
00:06:09,180 --> 00:06:09,640
对不起
Sorry.

172
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:13,480
对不起 对不起 给你
Sorry, sorry, sorry. Here they are.

173
00:06:13,700 --> 00:06:15,140
瞧瞧秋季的新品
Oh, look what's new for fall.

174
