355
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:54,240
乔把莉莉的车开出来玩了一下
Joe took Lily's car for a little spin.

356
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:56,720
发生了一点小事故 不过没事
Had a little fern-der bender, but it's okay. It's fine.

357
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:58,061
他刚刚画过的窗帘
Well, the curtains he drew on

358
00:12:58,061 --> 00:12:59,640
要送去专业清洁店才行
are gonna need to be professionally cleaned,

359
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:00,880
不过窗帘早就该送去洗了
But they were overdue.

360
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:03,240
是啊 重回这种干劲十足的状态真好
Yeah. It's fun having this energy back in the house.

361
00:13:03,260 --> 00:13:06,500
是啊 那个刚刚吃饱了布丁的小家伙呢
It is. Where is that little pudding-filled rocket, anyway?

362
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,520
他在这里
Oh, there he is. There he goes.

363
00:13:08,580 --> 00:13:09,938
-你看见他了 -他要去卫生间了
- You see him? - Okay, yeah, he's going into the bathroom.

364
00:13:09,938 --> 00:13:11,336
-他把门锁上了 -锁上了
- Okay. Oh. It's locked. - Locked?

365
00:13:11,336 --> 00:13:12,700
我们去开另外一扇门
I'm gonna go around to the other door. Yeah.

366
00:13:12,700 --> 00:13:13,540
-乔 -乔
- Joe! - Joe!

367
00:13:16,312 --> 00:13:17,559
马桶肯定堵上了
Okay, well, that's gonna clog.

368
00:13:17,559 --> 00:13:18,680
好吧 我来拿马桶塞
All right, I'll get the plunger.

369
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:19,680
亲爱的 听好了
Okay, now, sweetie, listen.

370
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:21,420
我们不能用这么多厕纸
We can't use that much toilet paper

371
00:13:21,420 --> 00:13:22,720
因为这样很浪费
because it's wasteful.

372
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:24,240
不好 我的钥匙
Oh, my gosh. My keys.

373
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:27,320
不 不 不 不要
No, no! No! No, no, no!

374
00:13:27,420 --> 00:13:28,679
真好 没堵住啊
Oh, good, it didn't clog.

375
00:13:28,679 --> 00:13:30,624
天呐
Okay. Oh, geez.

376
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:35,220
莉莉 是你把紫色颜料洒在地上的吗
Lily, did you spill purple paint on the floor?

377
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:36,959
是啊 今天的麻烦精是我呢
Yeah, I'm the problem today.

378
00:13:36,959 --> 00:13:38,022
天呐
Oh, geez.

379
00:13:38,350 --> 00:13:40,380
天啊 范德考夫沙发被毁了
Oh, God! The vanderkolff!

380
00:13:40,380 --> 00:13:40,680
什么
What?

381
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:42,800
天呐 沙发
Oh, God, the vanderkoff!

382
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:43,978
没事 没关系
It's okay. It's okay. It's okay.

383
00:13:43,978 --> 00:13:45,373
把它送去专业清洁店就好了
We'll, we'll just get it professionally cleaned.

384
00:13:45,373 --> 00:13:47,720
是啊 跟窗帘一起送去
Yeah, w-we'll just throw it in with the curtains.

385
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:48,000
球球
Ball!

386
00:13:49,340 --> 00:13:50,600
不 那不是球球
Oh, no, that's not a ball.

387
00:13:51,140 --> 00:13:53,299
不不不 那是个贵到吓死人的圣安杰洛牌玻璃碗
No. No, no, no. That's a criminally expensive Santangelo bowl.

388
00:13:53,299 --> 00:13:54,614
听着 我悄悄地绕到后面去
Okay, I'm gonna sneak around behind him

389
00:13:54,614 --> 00:13:55,940
你继续说话分散他的注意力
snd you're just gonna keep him talking.

390
00:13:55,940 --> 00:13:57,680
乔 你不想这么做的
Joe, you don't want to do this.

391
00:13:58,120 --> 00:13:59,900
现在你还没有犯下大错
You know, as of right now, you haven't done anything wrong.

392
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,600
把碗给我
You just hand that over to me,

393
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:04,046
大家相安无事 好吗
and it's like nothing ever happened, see?

394
00:14:04,046 --> 00:14:06,160
他又不是长着婴儿脸的罪犯 他就是个小孩而已
Okay, he's not baby face nelson. He's an actual baby.

395
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,159
你想来帮忙吗
Okay, you know what? You want to help out?

396
00:14:07,159 --> 00:14:08,677
扔点东西过来垫着 比如靠枕
Slide something underneath it like a throw pillow.

397
00:14:08,677 --> 00:14:09,597
扔球球
Throw!

398
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:16,760
我们都忘了小孩子有多麻烦 对吧
You forget what a handful kids are when they're little, huh?

399
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:18,020
是啊 我之前都没意识到 现在莉莉这么大了
Yeah, I didn't realize how easy we have it

400
00:14:18,020 --> 00:14:20,040
-我们过得有多舒坦 -是啊
- Now that Lily's so independent. - Yeah.

401
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:22,316
再说 我们也不像莉莉当年这么大时那样年轻了
Plus, we're not as young as we were when she was like this.

402
00:14:22,316 --> 00:14:24,300
米奇 我们是不是在讨论
Mitchell, are -- are we almost discussing

403
00:14:24,300 --> 00:14:25,520
我脑海中想的那件事
What I think we're almost discussing?

404
00:14:25,740 --> 00:14:27,680
也许我们不该急着领养孩子
Maybe we shouldn't rush into having another kid?

405
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:30,760
这是大事 而且我喜欢现在的生活状态
It's a big decision, and I love the way our lives are now.

406
00:14:30,780 --> 00:14:31,720
天呐 我也是
Oh, god, me, too!

407
00:14:33,078 --> 00:14:35,620
这不代表我们是自私的人吧
Th-th-this doesn't make us selfish people, does it?

408
00:14:35,620 --> 00:14:37,060
当然不是了
Of course not.

409
00:14:37,260 --> 00:14:39,120
小乔卡在井里了["好"字]
Baby Joe's stuck in the well.

410
00:14:41,132 --> 00:14:42,515
-管他的呢 -能有啥事
- Leave him. - He‘s fine.

411
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:47,780
不对 往左边放点
No, no, no. A little bit more to the left.

412
00:14:47,880 --> 00:14:48,940
你在这干嘛
What are you doing here?

413
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,560
不敢相信我得求你去购物
I can't believe I have to beg you to go shopping.

414
00:14:50,620 --> 00:14:51,360
我得确保
Well, I have to make sure

415
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:52,920
你把这东西放对地方
that you're putting that thing in the right place

416
00:14:52,920 --> 00:14:56,117
因为你觉得这份蠢工作对你很重要
since this stupid, horrible job is so important to you.

417
00:14:56,117 --> 00:14:57,940
海莉啊 我得说
Ay, Haley, I have to say,

418
00:14:57,940 --> 00:15:00,040
今天让我有点瞧不起你
today I lost a little bit of respect for you.

419
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:01,060
不送 歌洛莉亚
Goodbye, Gloria.

420
00:15:01,340 --> 00:15:03,560
你得学会站起来维护自己
You need to learn how to stand up for yourself.

421
00:15:03,980 --> 00:15:06,100
你知道你说出这话有多容易吧
Do you know how easy that is for you to say?

422
00:15:06,380 --> 00:15:09,040
才怪 说英语对我来说很难的
No, no. Nothing in English is easy for me to say.

423
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:11,320
跟你不同 我没有有钱的老公
Unlike you, I don't have a rich husband.

424
00:15:11,540 --> 00:15:13,760
大家都觉得我什么事都会搞砸
What I do have is a reputation for being a screw-up

425
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:15,400
什么事都坚持不下去
who never follows through on anything.

426
00:15:16,060 --> 00:15:18,120
这就是为什么 如果你没留意到的话
which is why, in case you haven't noticed,

427
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:20,340
两年的大学我已经读了第三年了
I'm in my third year of a two-year college program

428
00:15:20,340 --> 00:15:22,220
而且还住在父母的地下室里
and still living in my parents' basement.

429
00:15:22,420 --> 00:15:24,680
听着 我知道这份工作很挫
Look, I know that this job sucks,

430
00:15:24,680 --> 00:15:27,280
但也许能让我有所成就
but it might actually lead to something.

431
00:15:27,460 --> 00:15:29,340
你知道5年前谁在干这份工作吗
Do you know who had this job five years ago?

432
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:32,280
加文 而且他老板比他还混蛋
Gavin, and he worked for an even bigger jackass than he is.

433
00:15:32,500 --> 00:15:34,780
你好啊 午餐吃得可真快啊
Hey! That was a quick lunch.

434
00:15:34,900 --> 00:15:35,980
是啊 队排得太短了
Yeah, the line was too short.

435
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:37,560
他家没戏了 我不能被看见去那里进餐
It's over. I can't be seen there.

436
00:15:37,900 --> 00:15:40,180
我可不想让人觉得我是混蛋
I wouldn't want people to think I was a jackass.

437
00:15:41,584 --> 00:15:43,280
听着 我刚刚那么说
Uh, look, when -- when I said that,

438
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:43,997
真的不是...
I really didn't --

439
00:15:43,997 --> 00:15:45,540
首先 你刚刚都打算离开了
Okay, first of all, you were just leaving.

440
00:15:45,540 --> 00:15:46,780
第二 永远别回来了
Second of all, maybe permanently.

441
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:52,000
滚快点
Faster.

442
00:15:52,700 --> 00:15:53,459
你知道吗 加文
You know what, Gavin?

443
00:15:53,459 --> 00:15:54,600
-我受够了 -别
- I have had enough of -- - No.

444
00:15:54,600 --> 00:15:55,417
搞什么 为什么不行
What? Why not?

445
00:15:55,417 --> 00:15:56,980
是时候站起来跟他翻脸了
It's time I stood up to this guy.

446
00:15:56,980 --> 00:15:58,020
我可能会被抄
I'm probably gonna get fired,

447
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:00,360
不如趁还有牙医保险 痛痛快快翻脸
so I might as well get in a couple shots before I lose my dental.

448
00:16:00,460 --> 00:16:01,740
不 你刚刚说得没错
No, you were right before.

449
00:16:01,900 --> 00:16:03,080
像我这样很容易
It's very easy to be like me,

450
00:16:03,100 --> 00:16:04,580
不用脑子去想 先吼完再说
to scream first and think later.

451
00:16:04,940 --> 00:16:06,520
但世界不是这个样子的
But that's not how the world works.

452
00:16:06,680 --> 00:16:07,440
我去跟他谈谈
Let me go talk to him.

453
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,900
-不要 -要
- No. - Yes.

454
00:16:08,900 --> 00:16:10,400
这一切都是我造成的
I caused all this.

455
00:16:10,820 --> 00:16:12,880
不管怎样 时不时
Anyways, it's good for me every once in a while

456
00:16:12,880 --> 00:16:14,520
委屈一下自己挺好的
to swallow my pride.

457
00:16:18,180 --> 00:16:19,500
你想怎么样
What do you want?

458
00:16:20,280 --> 00:16:22,280
就想让你听听老娘的声音
I just want you to listen to my voice

459
00:16:22,280 --> 00:16:25,220
看着老娘的眼睛 仔细想想
and look into my eyes and ask yourself,

460
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:27,780
这个尤物一路从哥伦比亚闯到美国
"Did this woman made it all the way here from colombia

461
00:16:27,780 --> 00:16:30,120
难道不认识一些狠角儿吗
without knowing some very bad men

462
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:33,040
他们会不会帮她的忙呢
who would love to do her a favor?"

463
00:16:36,660 --> 00:16:38,880
我不知道接下来会发生什么
Okay. I don't know what's gonna happen next,

464
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:41,060
但道歉的感觉真好
but it feels so good to apologize.

465
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:44,799
天呐 我保住工作了
Oh, my god, I still have my job.

466
00:16:44,799 --> 00:16:47,086
真棒 我们去庆祝吧
Oh, that's great! Let's go celebrate.

467
00:16:47,730 --> 00:16:49,320
可惜 我去不了
Oh, you know what? I can't.

468
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,940
我得去他家前院的草坪上撒种子
I have to go spread seeds on his front lawn

469
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:52,880
那样他回家时 可以享受从鸟群经过的感觉
so he can run through birds when he gets home.

470
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:56,500
我还得再去道个歉
I have one more thing that I need to apologize for.

471
00:16:58,677 --> 00:17:01,712
叫我元素周期表 因为我全身都是"金属"[奖牌]
Call me the periodic table, 'cause I got all the "Metals."

472
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:03,420
不错啊 宝贝
That's nice, honey.

473
00:17:03,940 --> 00:17:04,738
卢克 你今天过得怎么样
Luke, how was your day?

474
00:17:04,738 --> 00:17:07,440
卢克拿到了邦尼菲斯品格正直奖
Well, Luke won the Boniface integrity award,

475
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:09,400
我可是拿到了
whereas I got all --

476
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:10,340
没搞错吧
Are you kidding me?

477
00:17:10,340 --> 00:17:11,578
那真是太棒了
That is fantastic!

478
00:17:11,578 --> 00:17:12,735
我为你骄傲...
I'm so proud of --

479
00:17:12,735 --> 00:17:14,145
怂人
The bonerface!

480
00:17:14,145 --> 00:17:16,680
得这个奖的人 大家都叫他怂人
You win that award, everyone calls you "Bonerface."

481
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:17,580
这是书呆子奖里的巅峰
It's the super nerd award.

482
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:20,180
一个女同学把我的内裤拉到头上
My underwear got pulled over my head by a girl.

483
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:21,760
一直都是斯科特·威勒得这奖的
It always goes to Scott Wheeler,

484
00:17:22,020 --> 00:17:24,200
但有人把他的车停到残疾人专用位上了
But someone pushed his car into a handicapped spot

485
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:25,471
然后我就拿到了这奖
So I'd get the award.

486
00:17:25,471 --> 00:17:28,360
我知道这事是谁干的
And I think I know exactly who did it.

487
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:29,255
-这个嘛 -就是曼尼
- Well -- - Manny!

488
00:17:29,255 --> 00:17:32,260
你陷害斯科特·威勒 所以我变成了怂人
You framed Scott Wheeler so I'd win the bonerface.

489
00:17:32,260 --> 00:17:32,860
这得通哦
It adds up.

490
00:17:33,180 --> 00:17:35,080
首先声音小点 你又不是装卸工
First, lower your voice. We're not stevedores.

491
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:36,560
第二你错了
Second, you're wrong.

492
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:38,060
第三 反正你活该
Third, it serves you right, anyway,

493
00:17:38,060 --> 00:17:39,080
谁让你勾搭莎拉·芬克的
after you hit on Sarah Fink.

494
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:40,400
得了吧
Oh, for god's sake.

495
00:17:40,580 --> 00:17:42,000
天涯何处无妹子
There are plenty of other girls out there.

496
00:17:42,100 --> 00:17:43,180
忘了她吧
Get over it.

497
00:17:43,669 --> 00:17:46,532
那是斯里兰卡的肉桂棒
That cinnamon stick is from SriLlanka!

498
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:47,680
放开我
Get off me!

499
00:17:47,800 --> 00:17:48,880
你身上一股香薰蜡烛味儿
You smell like a candle.

500
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:51,540
这是薰衣草味沐浴珠的味道 你这混蛋
It's lavender bath beads, you son of a bitch!

501
00:17:51,700 --> 00:17:54,880
那么荣获"最无谓撕逼"奖的是...
And the award for the saddest brawl goes to

502
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:56,100
够了 住手 给我住手
Okay, stop it! Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!

503
00:17:56,100 --> 00:17:57,629
是我做的 是我让你成了怂人
I did it! I did it! I got you the Bonerface!

504
00:17:57,629 --> 00:18:00,900
那个邦尼什么奖 叫什么来着
Ugh the Bonifa-- what's it called?

505
00:18:00,900 --> 00:18:02,000
都走开吧
Just get out of here.

506
00:18:02,620 --> 00:18:03,480
-你干的 -是我
- You? - Yes.

507
00:18:03,760 --> 00:18:04,160
为什么
Why?

508
00:18:04,340 --> 00:18:06,940
因为我不知道这是个给书呆子的奖
Because I didn't know it was a nerd award.

509
00:18:06,940 --> 00:18:09,660
我知道它是个奖 我想让你得一次
I just knew it was an award, and I wanted you to have one.

510
00:18:09,660 --> 00:18:11,240
然后你刚好排第二 好吧
And you were second in line to get it, anyway,

511
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:13,000
所以我就 你懂的
so I just, you know...

512
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:15,018
暗中耍手段 因为你觉得我是个废柴
Rigged it because you think I'm a loser

513
00:18:15,018 --> 00:18:16,380
靠自己的力量永远都赢不了一个奖
who could never win his own award?

514
00:18:16,380 --> 00:18:17,298
不 不是的
No. No.

515
00:18:17,298 --> 00:18:18,474
我 我只是
I-I just...

516
00:18:18,743 --> 00:18:20,240
因为艾丽克斯得了那么多奖...
Alex has her awards and

517
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:22,180
谢谢你对我这么有信心啊
Thanks for believing in me.

518
00:18:25,740 --> 00:18:27,120
乔马上就要过来了
Joe's gonna be here soon.

519
00:18:27,180 --> 00:18:29,100
我们得快点 窗已经弄好了
Let's pick up the pace. Window looks good.

520
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:30,080
把屋顶盖上去
Let's raise the roof.

521
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:31,700
杰 我觉得还没到完工庆祝的时候
I don't think it's time to celebrate, Jay.

522
00:18:31,700 --> 00:18:33,961
我们都还没盖屋 噢
We haven't even put on the roo-- oh.

523
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:39,660
宝贝
Honey.

524
00:18:40,220 --> 00:18:41,680
真的对不起
I am so sorry.

525
00:18:42,040 --> 00:18:43,700
你早上看上去那么沮丧
You just seemed so upset this morning,

526
00:18:43,700 --> 00:18:46,840
我就以为这是因为得奖日还有艾丽克斯
and I assumed it was about awards day and Alex.

527
00:18:47,620 --> 00:18:49,260
我根本不在乎得没得奖
I don't even care about awards.

528
00:18:49,605 --> 00:18:51,524
那你为什么不愿意去上学
Then why didn't you want to go to school?

529
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:54,440
该不会是因为
This isn't still about that fight

530
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:56,640
你跟曼尼在抢萨拉·芬克吧 是吗
that you're having with Manny over Sarah Fink, is it?

531
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,640
我根本就不喜欢萨拉·芬克
I don't even like Sarah Fink.

532
00:18:59,020 --> 00:19:00,640
我都已经叫她不要再打电话给我了
I told her to stop calling me.

533
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:02,580
好吧 那为什么曼尼还以为你
Well, then why does Manny think that you're...

534
00:19:05,280 --> 00:19:07,480
你没有勾搭她 是她勾搭你的
You didn't hit on her. She hit on you.

535
00:19:07,711 --> 00:19:11,042
所以你 你是在努力不让曼尼伤心
And you're -- you're trying to spare Manny's feelings.

536
00:19:12,020 --> 00:19:14,520
我真是世界上最笨的笨蛋
I am the dumbest person in the world

537
00:19:14,520 --> 00:19:17,880
居然以为你会需要我的帮助
to think that you would ever need my help

538
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:19,660
才能获得品格正直奖
to win an integrity award.

539
00:19:20,700 --> 00:19:22,080
我真是太为你骄傲了
I could not be prouder.

540
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:24,640
明年再说吧 艾丽克斯
Maybe next year, Alex.

541
00:19:25,840 --> 00:19:27,820
搞定 遮阳蓬都装好了
Okay. Awning is done.

542
00:19:28,100 --> 00:19:29,240
那本来应该是个吊桥的
Supposed to be a drawbridge.

543
00:19:29,740 --> 00:19:30,840
难道那些链条都没让你反应过来吗
Weren't the chains a clue?

544
00:19:30,980 --> 00:19:31,680
你还有脸喷我
A lot of criticism

545
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:33,429
你刚刚才把自己的鞋子锯掉了一半
from a guy who just sawe1d half his shoe off.

546
00:19:33,429 --> 00:19:34,860
开什么玩笑呢
Who are we kidding?

547
00:19:34,860 --> 00:19:36,360
我们把门装倒了
We got a wall on backwards.

548
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:38,220
我连那些东西该怎么装都不知道
I don't even know where that stuff goes.

549
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:40,550
看上去都不怎么像...
It barely looks like a --

550
00:19:40,550 --> 00:19:41,096
城堡
Castle!

551
00:19:41,220 --> 00:19:42,000
乔 慢点
Joe, wait!

552
00:19:43,240 --> 00:19:43,920
嘿 小家伙
Hey, buddy.

553
00:19:44,780 --> 00:19:47,970
嘿 这要是涂好漆了看上去会更漂亮
Hey, it's gonna look even better when it's painted.

554
00:19:47,970 --> 00:19:50,162
那遮阳蓬感觉不错
Ah, the awning's a nice touch.

555
00:19:50,453 --> 00:19:52,848
杰 这个城堡本来应该更...
Jay, this castle's supposed to look like so --

556
00:19:54,080 --> 00:19:55,680
我的天啊
Oh, my goodness!

557
00:19:56,940 --> 00:19:58,880
乔 看看你做的好事
Oh, Joe, look what you did.

558
00:19:59,380 --> 00:20:00,400
你觉得我会相信
Do you expect me to believe

559
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:02,858
一个两岁的小宝宝能瞬间摧毁一座城堡吗
that a 2-year-old can destroy a whole house in one second?

560
00:20:02,858 --> 00:20:04,234
-可以的 -淡定
- Oh, wow, yes. - Easy.

561
00:20:04,234 --> 00:20:05,220
绝对可以
For sure.

562
00:20:05,220 --> 00:20:07,460
杰 你要不要告诉我到底发生了什么
Jay, do you want to tell me what really happened?

563
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:10,100
一个人如果要成事
No one wins anything

564
00:20:10,100 --> 00:20:11,559
就需要家人和朋友的帮助
without help from family and friends

565
00:20:11,559 --> 00:20:13,460
指引你丢掉错的想法
who steer you away from bad ideas...

566
00:20:13,460 --> 00:20:14,600
慢着 菲尔 菲尔
Wait, Phil! Phil! Phil!

567
00:20:15,660 --> 00:20:16,938
并作出对的选择
...and toward good ones.

568
00:20:16,938 --> 00:20:18,540
我不知道我们今天这是怎么了
I don't know what got into us today.

569
00:20:18,540 --> 00:20:19,561
你说关于宝宝的事情吗
Oh, with the baby thing?

570
00:20:19,561 --> 00:20:21,640
是的 我现在最不需要的就是个熊孩子了
Yes. It's the last thing I need right now.

571
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:24,200
-我们都不需要了 -对
- It's the last thing any of us need right now. - Yeah.

572
00:20:31,340 --> 00:20:33,563
因为每个人的成功
Because every time anyone accomplishes anything...

573
00:20:33,563 --> 00:20:35,140
-背后都有 -做得不错嘛
- he or she achieves it... - Nice.

574
00:20:35,140 --> 00:20:37,460
无数个沉默的英雄
...with the help of a thousand silent heroes.

575
00:20:38,020 --> 00:20:40,460
无私的伙伴伸出他们的援手
the selfless team players who offer their support,

576
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:41,860
并不是为了被认可
not to be recognized,

577
00:20:41,960 --> 00:20:44,200
而是因为那是对的事
but because it's the right thing to do.

578
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:46,040
人们并不经常会因为
Awards aren't usually given out

579
00:20:46,140 --> 00:20:48,220
是个好人而被嘉奖 但是今天
being a good person, but today...

580
00:20:48,320 --> 00:20:49,120
他们会被嘉奖
they are.

581
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:50,920
女士们 先生们
Ladies and gentlemen, the winner

582
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:53,560
获得"马龙·邦尼菲斯"品格正直奖的是
of the Marlon Boniface integrity award is...

583
00:20:55,640 --> 00:20:56,960
真是太棒了
This is awesome.

584
00:20:57,580 --> 00:20:59,340
-卢克·邓菲 -不要啊
- Luke Dunphy. - No!

585
00:21:03,140 --> 00:21:04,500
艾丽克斯·邓菲
Alex Dunphy.

586
00:21:08,587 --> 00:21:11,680
哇 这真是个惊喜
Wow, this is a surprise.

587
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:14,500
让我来讲一个关于追梦小女孩的故事
Let me tell you about a little girl with a dream.

588
00:21:15,340 --> 00:21:17,120
非常 非常感谢
Muchas, muchas gracias.

589
00:21:19,620 --> 00:21:21,140
我刚才说到哪儿了
Where was I?

590
00:21:21,540 --> 00:21:22,300
颁奖日啊
Awards day...

591
00:21:22,840 --> 00:21:25,380
或者像桑杰·帕特尔认为的 是逾越节
or as Sanjay Patel knows it, passover.

592
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:27,820
那个小女孩想要的
All that little girl wanted

593
00:21:27,820 --> 00:21:29,720
不过是台计算器和一个机会
was a calculator and a chance.
